        "content": "ADMIN API\nOne endpoint for the admin dashboard (admin.html). Protected by admin_key in Config (header x-vaigai-admin). Actions: list_orders, list_leads, list_stock, order_update, lead_update, stock_set. Only fixed statuses can be written; every text field is cleaned and spreadsheet-formula safe. Create the Stock tab from sheets/Stock.csv and add columns to Orders / Leads as in the CSVs. Put the dashboard behind your own login or IP rule as well (for example Cloudflare Access).\nSet the values in the Config node (webhook key, Google Sheet ID, WhatsApp and Telegram details). The website sends the same key in the x-vaigai-key header. Credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, Telegram, OpenAI (assistant only). Nodes marked optional are disabled until you add credentials.",
